This repository is PRIVATE. It contains legal instruments, privileged
work product, corporate records, and dispute material that must not be
disclosed.

INTERNAL USE ONLY. No part of this repository may be copied, distributed,
published, mirrored, or incorporated into any public repository, artifact,
or derivative work without prior written authorization from the
Journey of Life general counsel.

EXCEPTION — published legal texts: files under legal-texts/ are the
canonical source of marketplace-facing texts (terms, privacy policy, etc.).
They become public ONLY through the versioned publication pipeline
(legal-text-sync.yml → jolarca). Direct republication of
draft, approved-but-not-effective, or privileged versions is prohibited.

The license governing the public marketplace application code lives in the
respective public repositories (see jolarca). Open-source
posture for code artifacts (CLA/DCO, AGPL-3.0 governance) is documented in
intellectual-property/copyright/. This notice governs internal custody of
legal records within the organization only.

Unauthorized disclosure of this material — in particular privileged
dispute material or personal data — is treated as a security incident of
the highest severity class (see SECURITY.md).
